{"title": "Frenzied Strain (Condition)", "pageid": 7931, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Frenzied_Strain_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Has status properties", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzied Strain Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/38/Frenzied_Strain_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Frenzied Strain</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strike\" title=\"Frenzied Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzied Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strike\" title=\"Frenzied Strike\">Frenzied Strike</a> adds a stack of Frenzied Strain. The barbarian takes a <b>-1</b> penalty on <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_Rolls\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack Rolls\">Attack Rolls</a> for every stack.</li>\n<li>All stacks are removed when <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzy_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/38px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/50px-Frenzy_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzy\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp/25px-Frenzy_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Frenzy_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frenzy\" title=\"Frenzy\">Frenzy</a> ends. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">RAGE_FRENZY_BURNOUT</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CRAGE_FRENZY_BURNOUT%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CRAGE_FRENZY_BURNOUT%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: add to duration\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/FreezeDuration\" title=\"Status properties/FreezeDuration\">FreezeDuration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/MultiplyEffectsByDuration\" title=\"Status properties/MultiplyEffectsByDuration\">MultiplyEffectsByDuration</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The attack roll is made before the stack of Frenzied Strain is applied to the attacker.</li>\n<li>The description used on this page has been edited for clarity. The in-game description is: <i>Using Frenzied Strike adds a penalty to Attack Rolls every time, stacking so that you miss more often. This adds up until the end of your Frenzy.</i></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Frenzied_Strain\">Sources of Frenzied Strain</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strike\" title=\"Frenzied Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/45px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/60px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frenzied Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp/30px-Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Frenzied_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Frenzied_Strike\" title=\"Frenzied Strike\">Frenzied Strike</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201444\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.06